Package: tubeos-installer
Version: 0.1.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-qrcode, python3-pil, qrencode, avahi-daemon, libnss-mdns, parted, rsync, grub-efi-amd64-bin | grub-pc, dosfstools, e2fsprogs
Maintainer: Pulsar OS Team <team@pulsaros.io>
Description: Tube OS Web Installer and OOTB Setup
 Web-based installer and first-boot setup for Tube OS. Provides a
 browser-accessible interface on http://tubeos.local or IP for installing
 Tube OS to disk and initial configuration (timezone, keyboard, user creation).
 Runs headless - no HDMI needed, just ethernet + browser.
